#    PerformanceEntry, PerformanceResourceTiming (now the navigation
#    entry's parent), PerformanceMark, PerformanceMeasure,
#    PerformanceNavigation (performance.navigation), performance.toJSON().
#    PerformanceObserver still delivers nothing, so supportedEntryTypes
#    stays [].
#  - performance.memory (Chromium's): this runtime's script heap from
#    JS_ComputeMemoryUsage (__vitaJsHeap, a reading kept for 1 s), in 100
#    KB steps.
#
# Gate: testpages/pages/JS-perf-timing.html (PERFTIME 10/10, Chromium
# 10/10; Chromium lists marks in recording order where the spec sorts by
# startTime, so that check compares them as a set).
